---
// Starts `hidden`; `CrtPrefScript` reveals it once JS has run, so a no-JS visitor never
// sees a dead toggle. That script owns `aria-pressed` and `data-crt` from then on;
// `aria-pressed="true"` here matches its default-on state.
---

<button type="button" data-crt-toggle hidden aria-pressed="true">
  CRT
</button>
